<title>USA: Washington Homes Q2 Jan 31 deliveries up.</title>
<headline>Washington Homes Q2 Jan 31 deliveries up.</headline>
<dateline>LANDOVER, Md. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Homes Inc said on Friday new-home deliveries were up 36 percent for its second quarter, which ended January 31.</p>
<p>The company delivered 298 new homes, compared with 219 for the same period last year. For the first six months of the 1997 fiscal year Washington delivered 579 new homes, up 25 percent from the 465 it delivered for the same period in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Second-quarter financial results will be released later this month.</p>
</text>
